{"code":"005725","name":"넥센우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1968년 설립된 넥센그룹의 모회사로, 자동차타이어용 튜브 등 고무제품의 제조·판매 및 물류사업을 영위하는 사업형 지주회사임. 2018년 넥센타이어(주)를 종속회사로 편입하였으며, 멕시코 법인을 신규 설립하여 글로벌 생산체계를 확장하고 있음. 주요 사업부문은 고무부문(타이어 제조·판매·렌탈), 물류부문, 임대부문, 기계부문, 골프장부문으로 구성되어 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":4430.0,"open":4300.0,"high":4430.0,"low":4300.0,"volume":9,"amount":39870.0,"ret_1d":-0.1127,"gap":-3.044,"range_pct":2.9345,"ret_5":-1.1161,"ret_20":4.2353,"ret_60":-1.1161,"ret_120":-6.3425,"ret_250":-4.3197,"ma20":4423.75,"ma60":4357.25,"ma120":4388.75,"ma200":4444.1,"close_vs_ma200":-0.3173,"close_vs_ma60":1.6696,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":17.66,"r2_60":0.2765,"slope_120":-6.7574,"r2_120":0.0998,"slope_250":-5.0354,"r2_250":0.1463,"high52":5570.0,"low52":3910.0,"pos_52w":31.3253,"dd_52w":-20.4668,"mdd_1y":-23.9815,"atr14_pct":1.7817,"vol_ann_60":30.6621,"vol_avg20":1226.6,"vol_ratio20":0.0073,"vr5":0.9993,"vr20":0.7396,"amount_avg5":3521087.0,"amount_avg20":5446580.5,"amount_avg60":3575109.0833,"obv_chg20":10.949,"turnover_20":0.6813,"pv_eff_20":6.2162,"rsi14":52.3995,"frgn_net_5":2439.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0677,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0677,"frgn_net_20":5088.0,"inst_net_20":-4020.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.1413,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.1116,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0297,"frgn_net_60":5085.0,"inst_net_60":-6000.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.1412,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.1666,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0254,"frgn_net_120":5071.0,"inst_net_120":-6000.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.1408,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.1666,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.0258,"foreign_ratio":10.54,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.12,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":491.0,"op_margin_q":4.8681,"op_qoq":-27.3669,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-2.3857,"rev_yoy":11.4845,"op_trend_4q":-0.1263,"fin_period":"202606","roe":8.36,"debt_ratio":114.9,"per":2.17,"pbr":0.16,"div_yield":4.06,"foreign_rate":10.54,"targe